0..70 Comment "// The forgetting map the checker applies, written out (#2130). In the"
71..149 Comment "// explicit form, a model whose sorts are manifest standing where its theory\'s"
150..223 Comment "// model is asked is written as the map\'s call, `forget[sort C = A](m) at"
224..302 Comment "// Model(Counter)`, naming each sort the map puts back with its carrier as the"
303..381 Comment "// manifest type names it; the sugared form leaves the call to the checker, or"
382..460 Comment "// states the crossing by an ascription, `(m : Model(Counter))`. The run reads"
461..499 Comment "// the same application in every form."
501..578 Comment "// The counter, counting up and down modulo three, and `observe`, which reads"
579..594 Comment "// any counter."
